干脆将雾凇影送给了他。谢尔盖感动哭了。","context_summary_i18n":{"cn":"你们驱赶了活死人，雾凇影平安无事。谢尔盖连连夸赞鱼王的魅力连活死人也为之倾倒，你们干脆将雾凇影送给了他。谢尔盖感动哭了。","en":"You fend off the undead, keeping the crystalfin safe. Sergey marvels that even the undead find the crystalfin irresistible. You decide to give him the fish, moving him to tears.","jp":"屍を追い払い、霧氷シャドウは無事守られた。屍さえも魅了するキングフィッシュの魅力を絶賛するセルゲイに、あなたたちは魚を譲ることを決め、セルゲイは感動のあまり涙を流した。","kr":"살아있는 시체를 몰아냈고 다행히 프로스트 쉐도우도 무사했다. 세르게이는 피쉬킹의 매력이 살아있는 시체마저 매료시켰다며 놀라워하며, 우리에게 프로스트 쉐도우를 선물받아 감동의 눈물을 흘렸다."},"context_summary_status":{"cn":"aligned_plot_summary","en":"aligned_plot_summary","jp":"aligned_plot_summary","kr":"aligned_plot_summary"},"context_summary_record_index":24143,"context_summary_record_indices":[24143],"context_summary_match_status":"aligned_exact_unique","context_summary_source_asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13231091","context_summary_direction":"next_numeric_summary","context_summary_distance":2,"episode_title_source_cn":"冬夜残响","episode_title_i18n":{"cn":"冬夜残响","en":"Chains of Eternity","jp":"冬夜の残響","kr":"겨울밤의 메아리"},"episode_title_status":{"cn":"exact_unique","en":"exact_unique","jp":"exact_unique","kr":"exact_unique"},"episode_title_evidence":{"source":"Config/Season.luae","table_key":"103","season_type":"103","entry_condition":"ed.ConditionX.IsUserInEp(\"Ep03\")","opening_quest":"13010101","episode":"ep3","status":"explicit_episode_and_opening_quest"},"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13231080","asset_path":"ep3/quest_story/NodeCanvas__DialogueTree__ep3__quest_story_13231080.decoded.json","graph":"stories/ep3/quest_story/13231080.graph.json","locales":{"cn":"locales/cn/ep3/quest_story/13231080.json","en":"locales/en/ep3/quest_story/13231080.json","jp":"locales/jp/ep3/quest_story/13231080.json","kr":"locales/kr/ep3/quest_story/13231080.json"},"machine_locales":{},"stats":{"source_node_count":3,"graph_node_count":3,"effect_event_count":0,"text_entry_count":2,"speaker_entry_count":2,"cast_state_line_count":2,"path_dependent_cast_state_count":0,"cinematic_count":0,